{{High Risk|Template:Maintenance|nocat=1|pagetype=Main}}
Displays an "Under Maintenance" notice box with a spinning gear icon, marking a page or section that is actively being reworked. Use it to set reader expectations while a rewrite is in progress — for a page that is merely incomplete, use {{T|Completion request}} instead.

==Syntax==
{{T|Maintenance|block=1
|v1=noun
|v2=info =
}}

==Examples==
===Naming what is under maintenance===
The first positional parameter fills in the noun in the default sentence.
{{T|Maintenance|_Y_=1|p1=template}}

===Custom message===
<code>info</code> replaces the default sentence entirely, and takes precedence over the positional parameter.
{{T|Maintenance|_Y_=1|p1=info = This section is currently being maintained due to performance issue.}}

===No parameters===
{{T|Maintenance|_Y_=1}}

